65
00:04:20.897 --> 00:04:22.798
Much better than that
noisy cramped city.

66
00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.571
It's kind of perfect, right?

67
00:04:37.485 --> 00:04:38.485
The house...

68
00:04:40.422 --> 00:04:43.456
