69
00:04:43.491 --> 00:04:45.018
Mmm-hmm.

70
00:04:45.053 --> 00:04:46.492
Mmm-hmm, it has.

71
00:04:46.527 --> 00:04:49.462
But we have done
some heavy sprucing.

72
00:04:49.497 --> 00:04:50.562
And uh...

73
