136
00:08:54.269 --> 00:08:55.269
Yeah, I'll take him.

137
00:08:55.303 --> 00:08:56.104
Are you sure?

138
00:08:56.139 --> 00:08:57.743
Yeah, yeah. Please stay.

139
00:08:57.778 --> 00:08:58.942
