144
00:09:56.199 --> 00:09:57.671
Wow, it's mommy and daddy.

145
00:10:07.177 --> 00:10:08.715
Scary?

146
00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.915
Just, it's j... mmm-hmm.

147
00:10:45.116 --> 00:10:46.116
Ooh.

148
00:10:53.058 --> 00:10:54.058
Hey.

149
00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:56.191
Sorry.

