and eventually drive.

209
00:15:18.422 --> 00:15:20.488
I know.

210
00:15:20.523 --> 00:15:21.523
Scary, right?

211
00:15:24.593 --> 00:15:26.593
This is where
you're gonna grow up.

212
00:15:26.628 --> 00:15:27.660
Big and tall.

213
00:15:27.995 --> 00:15:29.761
And then one day,
you'll bring home

214
00:15:29.796 --> 00:15:33.303
