and there tomorrow?

237
00:17:29.652 --> 00:17:30.750
- I just...
- Right?

238
00:17:30.785 --> 00:17:33.258
You know,
it's also our first night.

239
00:17:35.262 --> 00:17:37.427
Okay, okay.
What are you doing?

240
00:17:37.462 --> 00:17:39.363
