300
00:23:39.758 --> 00:23:41.120
Wish me luck.

301
00:23:41.155 --> 00:23:42.693
Good luck.

302
00:23:43.993 --> 00:23:47.830
Oh, oh, okay.
Okay, you finished.

303
00:23:47.865 --> 00:23:49.997
You finished.
Yes, you're so good.

304
00:23:50.032 --> 00:23:53.231
Yeah.

305
