422
00:42:20.647 --> 00:42:25.342
What he was uh... up to.

423
00:42:29.117 --> 00:42:31.689
So... so he... he was... he was...

424
00:42:35.321 --> 00:42:36.321
I saw her.

425
00:42:38.159 --> 00:42:39.257
Last night.

426
00:42:45.100 --> 00:42:46.770
