427
00:44:04.982 --> 00:44:06.179
Here you go.

428
00:44:06.951 --> 00:44:08.819
Yeah, here you go.

429
00:44:09.921 --> 00:44:10.921
Okay.

430
00:46:16.146 --> 00:46:17.816
