518
01:00:16.018 --> 01:00:17.248
Okay, okay. Look, look, look.

519
01:00:17.283 --> 01:00:19.085
Look at the truck, Liam.
Look.

520
01:00:19.587 --> 01:00:23.287
Don't you love your truck?
Don't you love your truck?

521
01:00:29.768 --> 01:00:31.196
