531
01:01:17.013 --> 01:01:20.212
Hey, little man. Hey.
Hey, hey, hey, hey.

532
01:01:20.247 --> 01:01:21.917
Hey, let's go.

533
01:01:23.822 --> 01:01:24.920
All right, let's go, buddy.

534
01:01:24.955 --> 01:01:26.724
